h. The work culture at Rohan makes space for lighter moments so that there is rarely a dull moment at the office or site. Dedicated events and training are planned for the leisure and learning of everyone at ROHAN. Sports days with enthusiastic team sports, spaces for personal experience sharing and a buzzing celebration for every festival are just some of the things that happen here!\n\n### Great Place to Work®","score":0.8571887194678196,"raw_content":null,"id":"4fdb9f-05"},{"url":"https://rohanlifescapes.com","title":"Top Real Estate Builders & Developers in Mumbai | Real Estate Companies in Mumbai - Rohan Lifescapes","content":"Home\n The Brand\n New Project in South Mumbai\n The Ruby\n Our Footprint\n Spotlight\n Life at Rohan\n NRI Corner\n NRI/PIO\n\n Company Overview\n From The Chairman’s Desk\n Vision & Mission\n Our Values\n Quality Policy\n Alliances\n Awards\n Joint Venture\n CSR\n Contact Us\n\n Residential Properties in South Mumbai\n Ongoing Construction Projects in Mumbai\n Upcoming Projects in Mumbai\n Completed Projects in Mumbai\n\n© Copyright. Rohan Lifescapes.   \nAll rights reserved.   \n| Disclaimer | Privacy Policy | Site Map [...] Rohan Lifescapes Logo\n\nSales+919167910056 +91-22-614 66 999 Contact Us\n\n Home\n The Brand\n Projects\n The Ruby\n Our Footprint\n Spotlight\n Life at Rohan\n NRI Corner\n\n Company Overview\n From The Chairman's Desk\n Vision & Mission\n Our Values\n Quality Policy\n Alliances\n Awards\n Joint Venture\n CSR\n\n Ongoing\n Upcoming\n Completed\n\n Blog\n Customer Reviews\n\n)\n\n...\n\n...\n\n...\n\n...\n\n...\n\n...\n\n  \n  \n\n## Canvas of Home Buying\n\nThe promise of luxury prevails in all our landmarks. Other prerequisites such as strategic premium locations, safety, convenience and premium amenities are a given.\n\nRead More +) [...] Read More +)\n\n Luxury must be comfortable, else it’s not luxury. For us, your comfort comes first!\n   \n  The Promise DeliveredThey call them apartments. We call them homes. The difference is with us, you live life here and don’t just see it pass by.\n   \n  The Amenities OfferedDon’t just live, instead lifescape your life with a lot more that we offer. Much more than the mere basics.\n   \n  The Proximity MeasuredNo matter how far you go, proximity to things that make every day special is a must. We’ve taken all your basics into consideration so that you can make each day special.\n   \n  The AppreciationWe work relentlessly to give back to you much more than what you invest with us.\n\n## What makes us iconic\n\n35+ PROJECTS\n\n7.2mn sq.ft. BUILT\n\n8000 CUSTOMERS\n\n25+ YEARS\n\n## Ongoing Projects","score":0.8544721307414544,"raw_content":null,"id":"3a1aea-06"},{"url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/rohanbuilders","title":"Rohan Builders - Great Living, Engineered.","content":"## Similar Companies\nNyati Group (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); Kolte-Patil Developers Limited (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); Panchshil Realty (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); Kohinoor Group Pune (Real Estate):  (Pune,, Maharashtra); Mantra Properties and Developers (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); Rohan Builders (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); VTP Realty (Real Estate):  (Pune, Maharashtra); VILAS JAVDEKAR DEVELOPERS (Real Estate):  (PUNE, Maharashtra); Godrej Properties Limited (Real Estate):  (Mumbai, Maharashtra); Gera Developments (Real Estate):  (Pune, MH) [...] Rohan Builders (1mo): Every Rohan project is built on countless decisions, processes, and people coming together with one shared responsibility—doing things right. Rohan Builders has recently been recognised with the Silver Safety Award (Below 1 lakh sq. ft.) by CREDAI Pune Metro for Rohan Viti, Wakad. The trophy was presented by the Hon’ble Minister of Labour, Maharashtra State, along with the Chief Fire Officers of PMC & PMRDA. More than the recognition, this reflects the everyday commitment of teams on-site and off-site, who choose safety, consistency, and care in every step. Grateful to everyone who made this possible.The effort continues. [Likes: 267, Comments: 7]; Rohan Builders (3mo): We’re delighted and humbled to share that Rohan Builders has been certified as a Great Place to [...] Christmas and welcomed the New Year, together. #Christmas #ChristmaswithRohan #GreatLivingEngineered #ChristmasCelebration [Likes: 111, Comments: 1]; Rohan Builders (5mo): We’re delighted to share that Rohan Builders has won two prestigious national awards at the 1st edition of the National CREDAI Awards: 🏆 1st Prize – Best CSR Initiative (National) 🏆 2nd Prize – Best Residential Project (Sub ₹80 Lakhs in Tier 1 cities at National level) for Rohan Abhilasha This was the first ever national-level awards program instituted by CREDAI, with 1,000+ entries received from developers across the country. The entire evaluation, shortlisting, and jury process was independently conducted by CRISIL. Best CSR Initiative – Why we won The jury recognised the long-term, scalable, and deeply impactful","score":0.8503455979489648,"raw_content":null,"id":"728a99-07"}],"response_time":4.63,"request_id":"87018b20-638c-4a36-878c-2b6f8b5e03da"}